---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Donate — Backupist" description="Support the development of Backupist with an optional donation.">
  <section class="wrap page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Optional, always appreciated</span><h1>Help Backupist keep going.</h1><p>Backupist is free to use. If it has made your backup routine easier, an optional donation can help support future maintenance and improvements.</p></section>
  <section class="wrap content"><div class="donate-box"><span class="kicker">Support independent software</span><h2>Use it for free. Give if you want.</h2><p>Donations are voluntary and do not unlock paid features. The app remains free to use whether or not you contribute.</p><div class="pending">Donation link will be added here when the project's preferred platform is confirmed.</div></div><div class="content-card" style="max-width:720px;margin-top:18px"><span class="kicker">Transparency</span><p>Backupist is proprietary freeware. Donations support the project but do not change the app's licensing or provide ownership rights.</p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
